  "body": "**Original comment by yurivict (Bitbucket: [yurivict](https://bitbucket.org/yurivict), GitHub: [yurivict](https://github.com/yurivict)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nThanks!\n\n‌\n\nI have instructions on how to install FreeBSD into a VM:\n\n‌\n\n> Is there an easy way to test under FreeBSD?\n\n1. Install the [FreeBSD VM image](https://download.freebsd.org/ftp/releases/VM-IMAGES/13.0-RELEASE/amd64/Latest/) into VirtualBox.\n2. Boot FreeBSD\n3. Install git: pkg install git\n4. Check out the ports tree: git clone [https://git.FreeBSD.org/ports.git](https://git.FreeBSD.org/ports.git) /usr/ports\n5. cd /usr/ports/graphics/art\n6. Install dependencies: pkg install -A `make missing`\n7. Build: make\n8. Install: make install\n\n‌\n",
